{'symbol': 'FDX', 'date': '2021-08-26 13:31:00', 'title': 'FEDEX WORKING WITH RELIEF AGENCIES TO DELIVER CRITICAL AID TO HAITI', 'text': "MEMPHIS, TENN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AS DOCTORS AND NURSES ON THE FRONTLINES WORK TO TREAT THOSE AFFECTED BY THE DEADLY EARTHQUAKE IN HAITI, FEDEX CORP. (NYSE: FDX) IS WORKING WITH MULTIPLE HUMANITARIAN AGENCIES TO DELIVER AID WHERE IT'S NEEDED MOST. THIS WEEK, THE COMPANY WILL OPERATE TWO DEDICATED CHARTER FLIGHTS INTO THE DISASTER ZONE TO PROVIDE HELP AND HOPE. TODAY, THE COMPANY TRANSPORTED 79 TONS OF CRITICAL MEDICAL SUPPLIES FOR DIRECT RELIEF VIA A DEDICATED CHARTER FLIGHT. FEDEX EXPRESS TEAM"}